HP's Contacts (com.palm.app.contacts), as modernized by webOS Archive for webOS Community
Edition: version 3.2.0, from the webOS CE project's tree (com.palm.app.contacts_3.2.0_all.ipk).
It opens on contacts kept on the device ("On This Device") instead of asking people to get
started with an HP webOS account.

The app was released by LG Electronics under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE); the 3.2.0
changes are webOS Archive's.

The app's files are here exactly as the package carries them, and Lunacy does not change them
(rule 5 in CLAUDE.md). A change Lunacy needs in the app is made in the webOS CE project and
comes here with its next release.
